<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB - no buyer T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	   PREV</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> March	  7/10  P	March	  7/10  P</p>
<p> April	   2/6  P	April	   3/6  P</p>
<p> May	   1 D/2  P	May	   1 D/2  P</p>
<p> July	  12/13  P	July	  10/13  P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	  PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> March		 3/2 D   March	   3/2 D</p>
<p> May		 14/13 D   May	   14/13 D</p>
<p> July	    17/15.5 D   July	17/15.5 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> March	  100/80 D    March     110/90 D</p>
<p> May	    110/90 D    May	 110/90 D</p>
<p> July	  140/110 D    July     140/110 D</p>
<p> August	160/120 D    August   160/120 D</p>
